WEBVTT

00:20:57.586 --> 00:21:00.225
Va shunday xulosaga keldikki

00:21:00.225 --> 00:21:03.267
uyqu neyrologiya fanini tushunish

00:21:03.267 --> 00:21:06.639
biz chindan ham

00:21:06.639 --> 00:21:08.754
ruhiy kasalliklar haqida

00:21:08.754 --> 00:21:10.677
yangi fikrlashga

00:21:10.677 --> 00:21:15.284
va bu bizni kuchsizlantiradigan avhollarni davolashga yo'l ochadi.

00:21:15.284 --> 00:21:19.155
Fantastik yozuvchi, Jim Butcher shunday degan:

00:21:19.155 --> 00:21:21.520
"Uyqu xudodir. Boring unga ibodat qiling"

00:21:21.520 --> 00:21:23.715
Va men ham sizga buni taklif qilaman.

00:21:23.715 --> 00:21:24.466
E'tiboringiz uchun rahmat.

00:21:24.466 --> 00:21:29.520
( qarsaklar)